Text: Our exper- iments on the “IRA Russian Troll” dataset have shown improvements over the state-of-the-art in the supervised scenario, while providing a com- pelling case for the distant-supervision scenario, which has not been explored before.3 In future work, we plan to apply our methodol- ogy to other political events such as Brexit as well as to other election campaigns around the world, in connection to which large-scale troll campaigns have been revealed.

